        <mxCell id="24" value="&lt;b&gt;Important&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;NAT Gateway provides outbound Internet SNAT using public IPs; it does not make egress private. For centralized inspected egress, route workload subnets to Azure Firewall. If NAT Gateway is used, attach it to AzureFirewallSubnet for Firewall SNAT. ARO standard architecture requires UserDefinedRouting with private API and private ingress." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#D6A800;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
